; Slow 1100mV 100C Model Fmax Summary             ;
+-----------+-----------------+------------+------+
; Fmax      ; Restricted Fmax ; Clock Name ; Note ;
+-----------+-----------------+------------+------+
; 105.2 MHz ; 105.2 MHz       ; clk        ;      ;
